### Sprint 1 requests. Server: http://localhost:8080
### Ovvoru "###" kku pakkathula green arrow irukkum.

### ===== T1: Company with city =====
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Madurai Spices",
  "industry": "Food",
  "website": "https://madurai.example.com",
  "city": "Madurai"
}

### ===== T2: Phone validation =====
### Thappu phone (400 varanum)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "bad.phone@example.com",
  "phone": "12345",
  "companyId": 1
}

###
### Sariyaana phone (201 varanum)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "good.phone@example.com",
  "phone": "9876512345",
  "companyId": 1
}

### ===== T3: Notes =====
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Called today. Wants a demo next week."
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1/notes

###
### Delete (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1

###
### Thirumba delete (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/1

###
### Illaadha contact (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/999/notes

### ===== T4: Dashboard =====
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard

### ===== T5: Pagination =====
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals?size=2

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals?size=2&page=1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals?stage=NEW

###
### size 500 ketaalum 50 ku mela povadhu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals?size=500

### ===== T6: Update / delete deal =====
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Acme annual license (renewed)",
  "amount": 300000.00
}

###
### Negative amount (400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad deal",
  "amount": -5
}

###
### Illaadha deal (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost deal",
  "amount": 100
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/deals/4

### ===== T7: Stage rules =====
### Deal 3 NEW la irukku. NEW > QUALIFIED (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/deals/3/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "QUALIFIED"
}

###
### QUALIFIED > WON (skip, 422)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/deals/3/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "WON"
}

###
### Deal 2 la irundhu LOST (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/deals/2/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "LOST"
}

###
### LOST deal ah thirumba maatha (422)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/deals/2/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "PROPOSAL"
}

###
### Closed deal edit (422)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try edit closed deal",
  "amount": 1
}

